  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "summon companion to deal damage and assist in battle",
    "skill1": "launch multiple magic projectiles at target",
    "skill2": "Passive: drain enemy energy on each hit; Active: two-hit strike",
    "skill3": "haste scales while companion is on battlefield",
    "skill4": "companion counterattacks and stuns when owner is controlled or struck hard, also blocking fatal blows",
    "skill5": "casting projectile skill also spawns leaves near companion"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Bryon]] opens with a **battle-start companion summon** that fights beside him and gains Haste while she remains on the field. His projectiles drain enemy Energy, while the companion counterattacks and stuns him when he is controlled or struck hard. The companion can also block a fatal blow, and projectile casts spawn leaves near her. He deals strong multi-target Magic damage against grouped enemies. Early companion loss or widely spread foes reduce both his protection and damage.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Bryon]] opens with a battle-start companion that fights untargetably beside him, drains Energy, and can block a fatal blow before making him briefly untargetable. Do not waste your first interrupt on the catcher if another enemy has the real ultimate threat. Once the save is spent, pressure [[Bryon]] with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Evie]] or [[Nerion]], and race him with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]]. Keep your line spread so his leaves and multi-target Magic damage do not chain."
